# The Peanut Butter Sandwich


## Assumptions
- The bread bag, bread, the peanut butter jar, and knife are all present.

## Steps

- Twist the bread bag tie counter clockwise to open the bag
- Reach in the bag and grab two peices of bread
- lay both peices of bread on a stable counter top side by side
- Now grab the peanut butter jar and take it near the bread
- Unscrew the jar lid off and break any seal to see the peanut butter
- Take the knife and scoop peanut butter out of the open jar
- With the peanut butter on the knife spread it onto one peice of bread
- After you spread the peanut butter on the bread take the knife away
- Put the peice of bread with no peanut butter ontop on the bread with peanut butter
- The bread sits on top of the peanut butter spreaded on the bread
- So the peanut butter needs to sit in between both peices of bread
- Put the sandwich on the plate.
- Put the knife with peanut butter into the sink and yell at your brother to clean it.
- take the bread bag tie and twist it clockwise to close the bag

## Done When
When there are three layers of food stacked on eachother.
